#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When jobs fail, you can use `job.error_message()` to find specific error "
"codes and messages to help you debug your workflows\n"
msgstr ""
"작업이 실패하면 `job.error_message()`를 사용하여 워크플로 디버그에 도움이 되는 특정 오류 코드와 메시지를 찾을 수 "
"있습니다\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`job.status()` will give more information on what's happening while a "
"Function is `RUNNING`, including:\n"
msgstr ""
"`job.status()`는 Function이 `RUNNING` 상태일 때 진행 상황에 대한 더 많은 정보를 제공하며, 다음을 "
"포함합니다:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`RUNNING: MAPPING`\n"
msgstr "`RUNNING: MAPPING`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`RUNNING: OPTIMIZING_FOR_HARDWARE`\n"
msgstr "`RUNNING: OPTIMIZING_FOR_HARDWARE`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU`\n"
msgstr "`RUNNING: WAITING_FOR_QPU`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`\n"
msgstr "`RUNNING: EXECUTING_QPU`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`RUNNING: POST_PROCESSING`\n"
msgstr "`RUNNING: POST_PROCESSING`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, after a Qiskit Function is complete, you can inspect how much time "
"is spent across each stage with "
"`job.result()['metadata']['resource_usage']`, as in the following example.\n"
msgstr ""
"마지막으로, Qiskit Function이 완료된 후 다음 예제와 같이 "
"`job.result()['metadata']['resource_usage']`로 각 단계에 소요된 시간을 확인할 수 있습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Expand for code example\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Expand for code example\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
